{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00417",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 4.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, am I early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.74,
      "end_seconds": 10.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.66,
      "end_seconds": 20.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out. She's been having a night-time cough, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.86,
      "end_seconds": 24.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Can I take your vitals now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.33,
      "end_seconds": 37.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.71,
      "end_seconds": 66.08,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 97 beats a minute, temperature is 37.3 degrees, oxygen saturation is 90 percent. And blood pressure 131 over 90, respiratory rate 20. How long are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.49,
      "end_seconds": 71.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.12,
      "end_seconds": 74.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.17,
      "end_seconds": 80.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.03,
      "end_seconds": 87.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.83,
      "end_seconds": 93.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Wheezing goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.91,
      "end_seconds": 98.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Have you had shortness of breath on walking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.38,
      "end_seconds": 112.94,
      "duration_seconds": 13.56,
      "text": "Yes, for three days. The, The wheezing? That's been for about two weeks. Okay, so with wheezing, mild, I'd say. It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.06,
      "end_seconds": 118.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "So, any leg swelling, runny nose or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.64,
      "end_seconds": 121.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.61,
      "end_seconds": 127.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.39,
      "end_seconds": 133.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "No weight loss or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.65,
      "end_seconds": 137.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.95,
      "end_seconds": 140.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.74,
      "end_seconds": 144.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Right, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.9,
      "end_seconds": 148.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.19,
      "end_seconds": 171.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Do your parents or siblings have any long-term illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.41,
      "end_seconds": 175.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "My uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.97,
      "end_seconds": 178.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "What's your current medication list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.32,
      "end_seconds": 184.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "I used to take Seretide inhaler, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.98,
      "end_seconds": 188.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.11,
      "end_seconds": 195.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "I had my thyroid operated on a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.49,
      "end_seconds": 201.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.13,
      "end_seconds": 220.27,
      "duration_seconds": 17.14,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest. I've never smoked. I'm mostly vegetarian. I walk for about half an hour most days. I drive a delivery van all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.72,
      "end_seconds": 226.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.0,
      "end_seconds": 232.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Hmm, no allergies that I know of, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 233.15,
      "end_seconds": 239.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to penicillin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.28,
      "end_seconds": 244.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Maybe, but I don't recall it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.75,
      "end_seconds": 248.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note both of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.02,
      "end_seconds": 266.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.41,
      "end_seconds": 270.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I, I have asthma. I have migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.18,
      "end_seconds": 277.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Okay, so. Okay, I can see asthma in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.79,
      "end_seconds": 280.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Shall we do the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.8,
      "end_seconds": 284.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Right, tell me if anything hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "You're speaking in full sentences, which is reassuring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.78,
      "end_seconds": 303.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.67,
      "end_seconds": 327.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "I can hear a widespread wheeze on both sides when you breathe out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.33,
      "end_seconds": 331.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Good, that's the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.63,
      "end_seconds": 364.69,
      "duration_seconds": 17.06,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with an asthma flare-up at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out an allergic reaction yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.55,
      "end_seconds": 370.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "So, should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.25,
      "end_seconds": 401.05,
      "duration_seconds": 29.8,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an asthma flare-up is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a chest X-ray to look into wheeze. Let's book breathing tests to look into asthma. Let's use prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for asthma flare-up. Let me watch you use the inhaler, a lot of people don't get the full dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.48,
      "end_seconds": 413.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the inhaler isn't helping or you can't speak in full sentences. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.87,
      "end_seconds": 416.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Okay, fair enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.33,
      "end_seconds": 424.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Book a review in two weeks. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.03,
      "end_seconds": 428.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}